    "voice": "produce_events/200400601/2004006010010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……え？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004006010020,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "きーんー。金ぴかの『きん』！\r\nいくらくらいするとやろ……？",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400601/2004006010020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……そうだな……１グラムあたり…………\r\n……毎日変わるんじゃないのか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004006010030,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "え？　毎日ー……？\r\nようわからんばい",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400601/2004006010030"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004006010040,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "──そいやったら、真珠はー？",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400601/2004006010040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "し、真珠……ええと…………\r\n…………なんでそんなこと知りたいんだ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004006010050,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "ん～と、『かぐや姫』がねー──",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400601/2004006010050"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004006010060,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "結婚して～って言ってくる男の人に、\r\n『金と銀と真珠でできた枝』が欲しか～って言うと",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400601/2004006010060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うん",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004006010070,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "それ、どんくらいすごかもんかな～って思って",
    "charAnim1": "smile3",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400601/2004006010070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……あぁそうか、今日の撮影のことだよな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うーん……わからないけど……\r\n大きさによっては、100億とか…………？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004006010080,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "ひゃ、100億～～～～～！？\r\nそいは……王子様でも諦めるばい……！",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400601/2004006010080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "100億なら、まぁな……\r\n──恋鐘はどう言うんだ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004006010090,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "……？",
    "charAnim1": "wait5",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp_s",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400601/2004006010090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "や、恋鐘は今日かぐや姫になるわけだろ？\r\nまぁ、そういう恰好をするってだけだけどさ──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──求婚者たちに、何を持ってきてもらうのかなって",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004006010100,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "……！\r\nえ、えっと……",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400601/2004006010100"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004006010110,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "うちは、大トロと……\r\nえっと…………──",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim4": "eye_right",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400601/2004006010110"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ははっ、それはすぐ手に入るんじゃないか",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004006010120,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "え～っ、入らんもん！",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charAnim4": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400601/2004006010120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "あははっ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004006010130,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "入らんって～、プロデューサー！",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200400601/2004006010130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "わかったわかった……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "恋鐘、今日の撮影のこと\r\nいろいろ考えてきてくれたんだな",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp_s",
    "charLabel": "kogane",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2004006010140,
    "speaker": "恋鐘",
    "text": "え？　うん！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
